{
 "_comment": [
  "AI air-production TECH registry - the single source of the has_worthwhile_* / has_*_tech triggers in",
  "common/scripted_triggers/WA_AI_PRODUCTION_air_tech.txt (GENERATED by tools/gen/gen_air_tech_gates.py).",
  "One entry per trigger; under it one entry per TECH TREE (3-letter tag, or \"generic\" for the shared",
  "vanilla-named techs). \"base\" ids are the non-BBA game, \"ad_tech\" ids the BBA one: a tree needs an",
  "entry in both to be covered in both. A tree with NO entry in a line is barred from that line outright",
  "(a country holds only its own tree, so a missing tree is silence, not a fallback) - the generator",
  "--check reports every tree present in another line but absent here as a WARN, so the omission is",
  "always a decision, never an oversight. \"exclude\" lists equipment/airframe ids the evaluator must never",
  "adopt (forced KEEP_OLD); the evaluator reads this file, so both tools share one list."
 ],
